Appendix A stone table-ന്റെ ഒരേ 46-row ordered family hidden generation-നും visible generation-നും സ്വതന്ത്രമായി forward consume ചെയ്യേണ്ട ownership രൂപം പരിശോധിക്കുന്ന clean Stage 1 control probe. row IDs 1..46 ആദ്യം backward archive-ൽ സൂക്ഷിച്ച്, reversal സമയത്ത് രണ്ട് സ്വതന്ത്ര replay stack-ുകളിലേക്ക് duplicate ചെയ്യുന്നു. hidden consumer ആദ്യ 7 rows മാത്രം consume ചെയ്യുന്നു; visible consumer അതിൽ നിന്ന് സ്വതന്ത്രമായി മുഴുവൻ 46 rows consume ചെയ്യുന്നു. expected outputs: reverse count 46; hidden count 7, first 1, last 7; visible count 46, first 1, last 46.

Hamlet, current row ID സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Juliet, backward archive stack സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Romeo, hidden forward replay stack സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Othello, visible forward replay stack സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Macbeth, reverse countയും പിന്നീട് hidden first row-വും സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Lady Macbeth, hidden consume count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Ophelia, visible consume count സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Cordelia, stack helperയും output helper-ഉം സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Desdemona, hidden last row സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Portia, visible first row സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.
Viola, visible last row സൂക്ഷിക്കുന്ന കഥാപാത്രം.

Act I: row IDs 1..46 backward archive-ലേക്ക്.

Scene I: row=1.
[Enter Cordelia and Hamlet]
Cordelia: You are a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: current row archive ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Hamlet and Juliet]
Hamlet: You are as good as Hamlet. Remember yourself.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: row 46 ആണെങ്കിൽ reversal.
[Enter Hamlet and Cordelia]
Hamlet: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Cordelia: If so, let us proceed to act II.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Hamlet]
Cordelia: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero. Let us return to scene II.
[Exeunt]

Act II: backward archive രണ്ട് forward replay stack-ുകളിലേക്ക് duplicate ചെയ്യുന്നു.

Scene I: reverse count=0.
[Enter Cordelia and Macbeth]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: ഒരു row pop ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Cordelia and Juliet]
Cordelia: Recall your newest memory.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: popped row hidden replay-ലേക്ക് push ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Juliet and Romeo]
Juliet: You are as good as Juliet. Remember yourself.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: അതേ popped row visible replay-ലേക്ക് push ചെയ്യുന്നു.
[Enter Juliet and Othello]
Juliet: You are as good as Juliet. Remember yourself.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: reverse count++.
[Enter Cordelia and Macbeth]
Cordelia: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene VI: 46 rows reverse ചെയ്താൽ hidden consumer.
[Enter Macbeth and Cordelia]
Macbeth: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Cordelia: If so, let us proceed to act III. Let us return to scene II.
[Exeunt]

Act III: hidden consumer rows 1..7 consume ചെയ്യുന്നു.

Scene I: count=0, first=0, last=0; reverse count output.
[Enter Cordelia and Lady Macbeth]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Desdemona]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Macbeth]
Cordelia: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: next hidden row pop.
[Enter Cordelia and Romeo]
Cordelia: Recall your newest memory.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: ആദ്യ pop ആണെങ്കിൽ first row Macbeth-ൽ.
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Cordelia]
Lady Macbeth: Am I as good as nothing?
Cordelia: If not, let us proceed to scene IV.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Romeo and Macbeth]
Romeo: You are as good as Romeo.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: last row പുതുക്കി count++.
[Enter Romeo and Desdemona]
Romeo: You are as good as Romeo.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Lady Macbeth]
Cordelia: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene V: count 7 ആണെങ്കിൽ hidden outputs.
[Enter Lady Macbeth and Cordelia]
Lady Macbeth: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big hero and a big hero and a hero?
Cordelia: If so, let us proceed to act IV. Let us return to scene II.
[Exeunt]

Act IV: hidden outputs, visible consumer setup.

Scene I: hidden count, first, last.
[Enter Cordelia and Lady Macbeth]
Cordelia: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Macbeth]
Cordelia: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Desdemona]
Cordelia: Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: visible count=0, first=0, last=0.
[Enter Cordelia and Ophelia]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Portia]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Viola]
Cordelia: You are nothing.
