Act V: visible consumer rows 1..46 consume ചെയ്യുന്നു.

Scene I: next visible row pop.
[Enter Cordelia and Othello]
Cordelia: Recall your newest memory.
[Exeunt]

Scene II: ആദ്യ pop ആണെങ്കിൽ first row Portia-യിൽ.
[Enter Ophelia and Cordelia]
Ophelia: Am I as good as nothing?
Cordelia: If not, let us proceed to scene III.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Othello and Portia]
Othello: You are as good as Othello.
[Exeunt]

Scene III: last row പുതുക്കി count++.
[Enter Othello and Viola]
Othello: You are as good as Othello.
[Exeunt]
[Enter Cordelia and Ophelia]
Cordelia: You are as good as the sum of yourself and a hero.
[Exeunt]

Scene IV: count 46 ആണെങ്കിൽ outputs.
[Enter Ophelia and Cordelia]
Ophelia: Am I as good as the sum of the sum of a big big big big big hero and a big big big hero and the sum of a big big hero and a big hero?
Cordelia: If so, let us proceed to act VI. Let us return to scene I.
